# Frontend workflow — read AGENTS.md

Full checklist, trust order, MCP/skills lists, and done-criteria live in
`AGENTS.md`. This file only auto-attaches that workflow when frontend globs
match. Do not duplicate `AGENTS.md` here.

Hard minimums (restated for reliability):
1. shadcn MCP before inventing a component from scratch
2. Context7 MCP or `find-docs` when API certainty is low / stale-doc bugs
3. Chrome DevTools verification before calling user-facing UI done
4. accessibility + impeccable before marking complete

If a tool/skill is unavailable, say so — do not silently skip to training data.
Skip the whole flow only when the prompt says to skip the frontend flow.
